[4.601997, "o", "    Enable --reflink[=auto] (FEATURE_CP_REFLINK) [Y/n] y\r\ncut (6.7 kb) (CUT) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  cut -F (FEATURE_CUT_REGEX) [Y/n/?] y\r\ndate (7.2 kb) (DATE) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable ISO date format output (-I) (FEATURE_DATE_ISOFMT) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support %[num]N nanosecond format specifier (FEATURE_DATE_NANO) [N/y/?] n\r\n  Support weird 'date MMDDhhmm[[YY]YY][.ss]' format (FEATURE_DATE_COMPAT) [Y/n/?] y\r\ndd (8.3 kb) (DD) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable signal handling for status reporting (FEATURE_DD_SIGNAL_HANDLING) [Y/n/?] y\r\n    Enable the third status line upon signal (FEATURE_DD_THIRD_STATUS_LINE) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable ibs, obs, iflag, oflag and conv options (FEATURE_DD_IBS_OBS) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable status display options (FEATURE_DD_STATUS) [Y/n/?] y\r\ndf (7.1 kb) (DF) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable -a, -i, -B (FEATURE_DF_FANCY) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Skip rootfs in mount table (FEATURE_SKIP_ROOTFS) [Y/n/?] y\r\ndirname (611 bytes) (DIRNAME) [Y/n/?] y\r\ndos2unix (5.5 kb) (DOS2UNIX) [Y/n/?] y\r\nunix2dos (5.5 kb) (UNIX2DOS) [Y/n/?] y\r\ndu (6.5 kb) (DU) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Use default blocksize of 1024 bytes (else it's 512 bytes) (FEATURE_DU_DEFAULT_BLOCKSIZE_1K) [Y/n] y"]
[4.602022, "o", "\r\necho (2 kb) (ECHO) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable -n and -e options (FEATURE_FANCY_ECHO) [Y/n] y\r\nenv (4.3 kb) (ENV) [Y/n/?] y\r\nexpand (5.3 kb) (EXPAND) [Y/n/?] y\r\nunexpand (5.5 kb) (UNEXPAND) [Y/n/?] y\r\nexpr (6.8 kb) (EXPR) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Extend Posix numbers support to 64 bit (EXPR_MATH_SUPPORT_64) [Y/n/?] y\r\nfactor (3.2 kb) (FACTOR) [Y/n/?] y\r\nfalse (314 bytes) (FALSE) [Y/n/?] y\r\nfold (4.8 kb) (FOLD) [Y/n/?] y\r\nhead (4 kb) (HEAD) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable -c, -q, and -v (FEATURE_FANCY_HEAD) [Y/n] y\r\n"]
