[4.609682, "o", "\r\n  Enable option \"hw\" (ether only) (FEATURE_IFCONFIG_HW) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Set the broadcast automatically (FEATURE_IFCONFIG_BROADCAST_PLUS) [Y/n/?] y\r\nifenslave (13 kb) (IFENSLAVE) [Y/n/?] y\r\nifplugd (11 kb) (IFPLUGD) [Y/n/?] y\r\nifup (14 kb) (IFUP) [Y/n/?] y\r\nifdown (13 kb) (IFDOWN) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Absolute path to ifstate file (IFUPDOWN_IFSTATE_PATH) [/var/run/ifstate] /var/run/ifstate\r\n  Use ip tool (else ifconfig/route is used) (FEATURE_IFUPDOWN_IP) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support IPv4 (FEATURE_IFUPDOWN_IPV4) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support IPv6 (FEATURE_IFUPDOWN_IPV6) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable mapping support (FEATURE_IFUPDOWN_MAPPING) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support external DHCP clients (FEATURE_IFUPDOWN_EXTERNAL_DHCP) [N/y/?] n\r\ninetd (18 kb) (INETD) [Y/n/?] y\r\n"]
