[4.609963, "o", "\r\nip neighbor (FEATURE_IP_NEIGH) [Y/?] y\r\nSupport displaying rarely used link types (FEATURE_IP_RARE_PROTOCOLS) [N/y/?] n\r\nipcalc (4.6 kb) (IPCALC) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable long options (FEATURE_IPCALC_LONG_OPTIONS) [Y/n] y\r\n  Fancy IPCALC, more options, adds 1 kbyte (FEATURE_IPCALC_FANCY) [Y/n/?] y\r\nfakeidentd (9 kb) (FAKEIDENTD) [Y/n/?] y\r\nnameif (6.9 kb) (NAMEIF) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Extended nameif (FEATURE_NAMEIF_EXTENDED) [Y/n/?] y\r\nnbd-client (6.3 kb) (NBDCLIENT) [Y/n/?] y\r\nnc (11 kb) (NC) [Y/n/?] y\r\nnetcat (11 kb) (NETCAT) [N/y/?] n\r\n  Netcat server options (-l) (NC_SERVER) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Netcat extensions (-eiw and -f FILE) (NC_EXTRA) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Netcat 1.10 compatibility (+2.5k) (NC_110_COMPAT) [Y/n/?] y\r\nnetstat (10 kb) (NETSTAT) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable wide output (FEATURE_NETSTAT_WIDE) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable PID/Program name output (FEATURE_NETSTAT_PRG) [Y/n/?] y\r\nnslookup (10 kb) (NSLOOKUP) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Use internal resolver code instead of libc (FEATURE_NSLOOKUP_BIG) [Y/n] y\r\n    Enable long options (FEATURE_NSLOOKUP_LONG_OPTIONS) [Y/n] y\r\nntpd (23 kb) (NTPD) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Make ntpd usable as a NTP server (FEATURE_NTPD_SERVER) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Make ntpd understand /etc/ntp.conf (FEATURE_NTPD_CONF) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support md5/sha1 message authentication codes (FEATURE_NTP_AUTH) [Y/n] y\r\nping (10 kb) (PING) [Y/n/?] y\r\nping6 (11 kb) (PING6) [Y/n/?] y\r\nEnable fancy ping output (FEATURE_FANCY_PING) [Y/n/?] y\r\npscan (6.2 kb) (PSCAN) [Y/n/?] y\r\nroute (9 kb) (ROUTE) [Y/n/?] y\r\nslattach (6.3 kb) (SLATTACH) [Y/n/?] y\r\nssl_client (28 kb) (SSL_CLIENT) [Y/n/?] y\r\nssl_server (test TLS server) (SSL_SERVER) [Y/n/?] y"]
[4.610043, "o", "\r\ntc (8.3 kb) (TC) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable ingress (FEATURE_TC_INGRESS) [Y/n] y\r\ntcpsvd (14 kb) (TCPSVD) [Y/n/?] y\r\nudpsvd (13 kb) (UDPSVD) [Y/n/?] y\r\ntelnet (8.8 kb) (TELNET) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Pass TERM type to remote host (FEATURE_TELNET_TTYPE) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Pass USER type to remote host (FEATURE_TELNET_AUTOLOGIN) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable window size autodetection (FEATURE_TELNET_WIDTH) [Y/n] y\r\ntelnetd (13 kb) (TELNETD) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Include self-test (telnetd -@) (FEATURE_TELNETD_SELFTEST_DEBUG) [N/y/?] n\r\n  Support standalone telnetd (not inetd only) (FEATURE_TELNETD_STANDALONE) [Y/n/?] y\r\n    Default port (FEATURE_TELNETD_PORT_DEFAULT) [23] 23\r\n"]
[4.610177, "o", "    Support -w SEC option (inetd wait mode) (FEATURE_TELNETD_INETD_WAIT) [Y/n/?] y\r\ntftp (11 kb) (TFTP) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable progress bar (FEATURE_TFTP_PROGRESS_BAR) [Y/n] y\r\n  tftp-hpa compat (support -c get/put FILE) (FEATURE_TFTP_HPA_COMPAT) [Y/n] y\r\ntftpd (10 kb) (TFTPD) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable 'tftp get' and/or tftpd upload code (FEATURE_TFTP_GET) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable 'tftp put' and/or tftpd download code (FEATURE_TFTP_PUT) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable 'blksize' and 'tsize' protocol options (FEATURE_TFTP_BLOCKSIZE) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable debug (TFTP_DEBUG) [N/y/?] n\r\ntraceroute (11 kb) (TRACEROUTE) [Y/n/?] y\r\ntraceroute6 (12 kb) (TRACEROUTE6) [Y/n/?] y\r\nEnable verbose output (FEATURE_TRACEROUTE_VERBOSE) [Y/n/?] y\r\nEnable -I option (use ICMP instead of UDP) (FEATURE_TRACEROUTE_USE_ICMP) [Y/n] y\r\ntunctl (6.4 kb) (TUNCTL) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support owner:group assignment (FEATURE_TUNCTL_UG) [Y/n/?] y\r\nvconfig (2.6 kb) (VCONFIG) [Y/n/?] y\r\nwget (41 kb) (WGET) [Y/n/?] y"]
[4.61038, "o", "\r\n  Enable long options (FEATURE_WGET_LONG_OPTIONS) [Y/n] y\r\n  Enable progress bar (+2k) (FEATURE_WGET_STATUSBAR) [Y/n] y\r\n  Enable FTP protocol (+1k) (FEATURE_WGET_FTP) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Enable HTTP authentication (FEATURE_WGET_AUTHENTICATION) [Y/n/?] y\r\n"]
[4.610422, "o", "  Enable timeout option -T SEC (FEATURE_WGET_TIMEOUT) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support HTTPS using internal TLS code (FEATURE_WGET_HTTPS) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Try to connect to HTTPS using openssl (FEATURE_WGET_OPENSSL) [Y/n/?] y\r\nwhois (6.5 kb) (WHOIS) [Y/n/?] y\r\nzcip (8.7 kb) (ZCIP) [Y/n/?] y\r\nudhcpd (21 kb) (UDHCPD) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Answer to BOOTP requests as well (FEATURE_UDHCPD_BOOTP) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Select IP address based on client MAC (FEATURE_UDHCPD_BASE_IP_ON_MAC) [N/y/?] n\r\n  Rewrite lease file at every new acknowledge (FEATURE_UDHCPD_WRITE_LEASES_EARLY) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Absolute path to lease file (DHCPD_LEASES_FILE) [/var/lib/misc/udhcpd.leases] /var/lib/misc/udhcpd.leases\r\ndumpleases (5.3 kb) (DUMPLEASES) [Y/n/?] y\r\ndhcprelay (5.5 kb) (DHCPRELAY) [Y/n/?] y\r\nudhcpc (24 kb) (UDHCPC) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Verify that the offered address is free, using ARP ping (FEATURE_UDHCPC_ARPING) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Do not pass malformed host and domain names (FEATURE_UDHCPC_SANITIZEOPT) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Absolute path to config script (UDHCPC_DEFAULT_SCRIPT) [/usr/share/udhcpc/default.script] /usr/share/udhcpc/default.script\r\nAbsolute path to config script for IPv6 (UDHCPC6_DEFAULT_SCRIPT) [/usr/share/udhcpc/default6.script] /usr/share/udhcpc/default6.script\r\nudhcpc6 (21 kb) (UDHCPC6) [Y/n/?] y"]
[4.610503, "o", "\r\n  Support RFC 3646 (DNS server and search list) (FEATURE_UDHCPC6_RFC3646) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support RFC 4704 (Client FQDN) (FEATURE_UDHCPC6_RFC4704) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support RFC 4833 (Timezones) (FEATURE_UDHCPC6_RFC4833) [Y/n/?] y\r\n  Support RFC 5970 (Network Boot) (FEATURE_UDHCPC6_RFC5970) [Y/n/?] y\r\n*\r\n* Common options for DHCP applets\r\n*\r\n"]
